message: "If you use eccles_gui in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Eccles GUI"
abstract: "Ultra low RAM UI engine for microcontrollers: band rendering of a widget tree with dirty rectangles, anti aliased 2D drawing and a fixed point software 3D rasteriser. Plain C99, no heap, no floats."
type: software
